{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Mole or Nothing&quot;</strong> is a deck-building, turn-based strategy game that combines resource gathering with a high-stakes game of chicken.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players bring their constructed decks into the dungeon, using their cards strategically to reach the deepest depths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590110/extras/e7000950aa6aecc985a52dfa760ede97.avif?t=1760413608\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dungeon lie various gemstones that can be collected and exchanged for gold upon returning to the surface.<br>Use the gold you\u2019ve earned to purchase stronger cards, enhance your deck, and push even further on your next descent.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, as turns pass, the dungeon will begin to collapse.<br>If you get caught in the collapse, you\u2019ll lose all the gemstones you\u2019ve collected\u2014so you\u2019ll need to decide when to cut your losses and return.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590110/extras/b9cd994d56125b4aee5758d4fc267981.avif?t=1760413608\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How far will you go? How long will you keep gathering? When will you retreat?<br>Making the right decisions in the moment is the key to mastering the game.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2590110?t=1760413608","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2590110?t=1760413608","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2590110/52718d2678e5d451dc4e05523a33e291f14dd272/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760413608","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steam